5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! Do you think the wolf is someone who looks really scary, or maybe someone super nice? Hehe!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best. I think we should all be kind to each other while we figure this out.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Let's not get too soft. We need to be brave and find the wolf quickly. I'll be watching everyone's reactions closely.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,I agree with Takumi! Let's keep our energy up but stay focused. I'm curious to see how everyone handles the pressure!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,A predictable start. I shall remain an observer for now. Let us see who attempts to steer the conversation too aggressively.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're so mysterious! Are you trying to act like a cool detective? I bet you have a secret plan already!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, you're always so cheerful. I think it's a good idea to just talk and get to know each other first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Talking is fine, but we need a strategy. @Mio, you seem energetic; do you have any ideas on how to spot a liar?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Hmm, maybe we can look for people who agree too quickly? Or people who get defensive when asked a simple question!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"A basic approach, Mio, but effective. I will be analyzing the gaps between your words and your intentions.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, that sounds like a fun game! I'll be super honest, so you can't catch me! Hehe!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,I hope we can all trust each other. It would be sad if we accused someone who is actually a good person.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Trust is a luxury, Minato. We have to be realistic. If someone is acting weird, we have to call them out.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Takumi is right, but let's not be too mean. We can be firm but friendly!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,The tension is already beginning to surface. It is quite amusing to watch.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready for the night! I hope the Seer finds something super spooky! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
