36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Did anyone have any weird dreams? I feel like something exciting is about to happen!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning... I slept okay. I wonder if the Seer found any clues last night?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Let's get straight to it. If the Seer knows something, they should tell us now so we don't waste time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're very eager! But revealing the Seer too early is dangerous. Maybe we should wait a bit?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,The urgency in Takumi's voice is noted. It is often a sign of someone wanting to control the pace of the game.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're doing the detective thing again! Hehe! @Mio, do you think the Seer is scared of the wolf?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think it's better to be safe. If the Seer stays hidden, the wolf won't know who to attack.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, I'm not trying to control anything. I just want to win. Why is being decisive a bad thing?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Mio,,"It's not bad, Takumi! But we have to be smart. I'm actually feeling very confident about the situation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,Confidence can be a shield or a lure. I am curious about Mio's sudden change in tone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, you sound like you know a secret! Are you the Seer? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, don't pressure her! If she is the Seer, she might be worried.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"If Mio is the Seer and she's confident, she should just say who the wolf is. Why play games?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Okay, I can't keep it in! I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi. He is the Werewolf!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"A bold claim. Takumi, I believe the floor is yours to respond to this accusation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,What?! Takumi is the wolf?! No way! He looks too brave to be a sneaky wolf! Hehe!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Minato,,"Oh no... Takumi, is it true? I really didn't want to believe it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Takumi,,This is ridiculous! Mio is lying to frame me! She's the wolf and she's trying to trick you all!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm not lying! I saw it with my own eyes! Everyone, we have to vote for Takumi!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The evidence provided by the Seer is direct. Unless Takumi can provide a logical counter-argument, the choice is clear.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
